      </p>

      <h2>8. Changes to Terms</h2>

      <p>
        We may update these Terms & Conditions at any time. Continued use of ClosetSwipe after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Contact</h2>

      <p>
        For questions regarding these Terms & Conditions, contact:
      </p>

      <p>
        <a class="inline" href="mailto:support@closetswipe.co.uk">
          support@closetswipe.co.uk
        </a>
      </p>

    </section>

  </main>

</body>
</html>
